WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:02.360
Hi, I'm Pablo Poveda.

00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:05.860
I'm an engineering manager with over 15
years of experience in software.

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:10.120
I started as a developer and gradually
moved into leading engineering projects

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.170
and teams.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:14.580
I've managed the department of 20 people
and led nearly 30 projects.

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:19.980
What I enjoy most is building teams that
work well, giving people autonomy, helping

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:23.880
them grow, and making decisions that make
sense for both technology and business.

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:26.920
I'm also deeply interested in artificial
intelligence.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:30.840
I've studied AI engineering and
experimenting with agents and new ways to

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:32.320
build software and work as a team.

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:34.940
I want to keep building great products
with great people.

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:37.700
If you'd like to know more about me, talk
to my avatar.

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:40.120
Ask about my experience or how I work.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:41.890
That's why I build this website.
